+
+- **Severity:** Medium
+- **File:line:** `specs/stories/rlv-7-persistent-per-power-mod-chips.md:96`, `specs/stories/rlv-7-persistent-per-power-mod-chips.md:149`; `public/js/game/power-mod-chips.js:33`, `public/js/game/power-mod-chips.js:41`
